  "question": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/fnzNC8mLQ5MK_3Mmkm6R5i7b9p7Ns0WbFhv_XQ0-5DI.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\nA block of mass $m$ slides with speed $v$ on a frictionless table towards another stationary block of mass $m$. A massless spring with spring constant $\\mathrm{k}$ is attached to the second block as shown in figure. The maximum distance the spring gets compress through is",
